      "hash64": "CCBC439464ECF428",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Ah, if it isn’t [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! If only you’d\\nbeen\\r\\nhere\\r\\na few\\r\\nminutes\\r\\nearlier![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
