          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_01",
      "hash64": "AE04A130EA7201FC",
      "text": "Hey, did those lousy three Pokémon come here?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_caretaker_02",
      "hash64": "CCBC469464ECF941",
      "text": "I believe you mean the LOYAL Three, Carmine.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_02",
      "hash64": "AE04A430EA720715",
      "text": "Forget about that silly title![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_caretaker_03",
      "hash64": "CCBC459464ECF78E",
      "text": "Always with your attitude...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_caretaker_04",
      "hash64": "CCBC489464ECFCA7",
      "text": "But yes, you did miss out on an incredible treat!\\c\\nThe Loyal Three were just visiting our humble\\nlittle hall![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_caretaker_05",
      "hash64": "CCBC479464ECFAF4",
      "text": "It seemed they wished to collect the shining\\nmasks we’ve kept safe here at Kitakami Hall...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_caretaker_06",
      "hash64": "CCBC4A9464ED000D",
      "text": "so naturally we representatives of the hall were\\nhappy to return the masks to them with all haste![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_03",
      "hash64": "AE04A330EA720562",
      "text": "You gave them the masks?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_caretaker_07",
      "hash64": "CCBC499464ECFE5A",
      "text": "And we offered them a platter of our special\\nKitakami Mochi, packed full of our best herbs!\\r\\nThe Loyal Three gobbled them up in a flash![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_04",
      "hash64": "AE049E30EA71FCE3",
      "text": "And you FED them?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_person_01",
      "hash64": "5772BA2E93A27FE3",
      "text": "Kitakami Mochi are full of nutrition! The Loyal\\nThree are bigger and stronger now, I’m sure!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_05",
      "hash64": "AE049D30EA71FB30",
      "text": "But those lousy three are the bad guys! The masks\\nbelong to Ogerpon!\\c\\nUgh, I really wish I could tell them everything...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_06",
      "hash64": "AE04A030EA720049",
      "text": "So, where did those three go?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_caretaker_08",
      "hash64": "CCBC3C9464ECE843",
      "text": "They went at once to ascend Oni Mountain![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_caretaker_09",
      "hash64": "CCBC3B9464ECE690",
      "text": "Perhaps they have it in mind to finish off the\\nterrible ogre that lurks in the Dreaded Den.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_caretaker_10",
      "hash64": "CCB8BE9464E9DC52",
      "text": "No wonder they were dubbed the Loyal Three!\\nSuch hardworking heroes they are! Hahaha!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_07",
      "hash64": "AE049F30EA71FE96",
      "text": "This isn’t the time to be laughing at all![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_08",
      "hash64": "AE04AA30EA721147",
      "text": "If the story we heard is true, then those three\\nmust’ve gone to get revenge on Ogerpon.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_09",
      "hash64": "AE04A930EA720F94",
      "text": "They say the ogre fought using the powers of its\\nmasks.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_10",
      "hash64": "AE011C30EA6EEA26",
      "text": "But Ogerpon doesn’t have any masks right now,\\nright?! It won’t stand a chance![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_select_01",
      "hash64": "CAA525969695A084",
      "text": "We should help it!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_select_02",
      "hash64": "CAA528969695A59D",
      "text": "Let’s return its mask!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_11",
      "hash64": "AE011D30EA6EEBD9",
      "text": "Yeah, we’re on the same page! But we should\\nsplit up![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_12",
      "hash64": "AE011A30EA6EE6C0",
      "text": "You head to the Dreaded Den and help\\nOgerpon![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_13",
      "hash64": "AE011B30EA6EE873",
      "text": "I’ll go back home to get the mask fixed up! Give\\nme the mask and the crystal![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_system_01",
      "hash64": "DC64F7DF66445A4F",
      "text": "You gave Carmine the Teal Mask and the Crystal\\nCluster.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_14",
      "hash64": "AE012030EA6EF0F2",
      "text": "Thanks![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_sister_15",
      "hash64": "AE012130EA6EF2A5",
      "text": "I’ll head your way the moment the mask’s fixed!\\nUntil then, make sure Ogerpon’s safe![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0350_caretaker_11",
      "hash64": "CCB8BF9464E9DE05",
      "text": "The Loyal Three were headed up Oni Mountain\\nwhen we last saw them.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
